# Per-package USE flags of the machines this binhost serves.
#
# A binary is only accepted by a machine whose USE flags for that package
# are the same, so this file and the machines' /etc/portage/package.use have
# to say the same thing.  The builder adds nothing of its own: build-time
# dependency loops are broken automatically for one build and the packages
# are then rebuilt as configured here.

